#: ../../02-architecture.md:97 d9edc4cebd544dde97121b2aef8b50dd
msgid ""
"Default install prefix is `/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`). One "
"process per host is the unit of deployment; extra hosts are operator-owned "
"HA, not an in-tree orchestrator. `switchname` in "
"`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` only overrides hostname for "
"DB/CURL identity in clustered configs."
msgstr ""
"默认安装前缀为 `/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。每台主机上的一个进程是部署单元；额外主机属于运维自建 "
"HA，并非树内编排器。`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/switch.conf.xml` 中的 `switchname` "
"仅在集群配置中覆盖主机名，用于 DB/CURL 身份。"

