msgid "Core runtime"
msgstr "核心运行时"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:124 590afaa79ad14d8a9b84a702f3d4d418
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: APR/memory pools, directories, SQLite, SQL flags, "
"session thread pool (`SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL`), signal handlers, "
"`SWITCH_EVENT_STARTUP`."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：APR/内存池、目录、SQLite、SQL "
"标志、会话线程池（`SCF_SESSION_THREAD_POOL`）、信号处理、`SWITCH_EVENT_STARTUP`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:125 5f2e51e09ae84bfba57966dd7e61a930
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch.c` (`main`), `switch_core_init()` / "
"`switch_core_init_and_modload()` in `src/switch_core.c`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch.c`（`main`）、`src/switch_core.c` 中的 `switch_core_init()` "
"/ `switch_core_init_and_modload()`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:126 36d7442429524b08b98fa8ec94489323
msgid ""
"**Important dependencies**: bundled APR (`libs/apr`), SQLite, `libs/srtp`, "
"`libs/libvpx`."
msgstr "**重要依赖**：捆绑的 APR（`libs/apr`）、SQLite、`libs/srtp`、`libs/libvpx`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:127 16920f165c0f4c15bbdaf5a6453556a5
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: init aborts if APR or SQLite cannot start; "
"`SCF_NO_NEW_SESSIONS` is set until the core is ready."
msgstr "**失败模式**：APR 或 SQLite 无法启动则初始化中止；核心就绪前会设置 `SCF_NO_NEW_SESSIONS`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:129 ea665230df554c6f968b3e1715818082
msgid "XML configuration"
msgstr "XML 配置"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:131 f95d8bc21b0f4b40b1455cad09f2da60
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: parse `conf_dir/freeswitch.xml`, expand preprocessor "
"includes (`X-PRE-PROCESS` / `#include` / `#set`), serve sections "
"(`configuration`, `dialplan`, `directory`, `languages`, `chatplan`). "
"`mod_xml_curl` / `mod_xml_ldap` can replace file-backed sections at runtime "
"by installing `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()`."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：解析 `conf_dir/freeswitch.xml`，展开预处理器 include（`X-PRE-PROCESS` / "
"`#include` / "
"`#set`），提供各节（`configuration`、`dialplan`、`directory`、`languages`、`chatplan`）。`mod_xml_curl`"
" / `mod_xml_ldap` 可通过安装 `switch_xml_set_open_root_function()` 在运行时替换基于文件的节。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:132 f64938a301f644378b2d24babd14be34
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_xml.c` (`switch_xml_open_root`, "
"`__switch_xml_open_root`), root document `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_xml.c`（`switch_xml_open_root`、`__switch_xml_open_root`），根文档"
" `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:133 af246fe93b694a2884d473c0dce6a34d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Compiled artifact**: `log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml` (comment in "
"`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`: `${prefix}/log/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`). "
"Memory-mapped while running — do not edit it."
msgstr ""
"**编译产物**：`log_dir/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`（`conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml` 注释写的是 "
"`${prefix}/log/freeswitch.xml.fsxml`）。运行时内存映射 — 不要编辑。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:134 d4a054aa116a4477a31bf6e24d4150d0
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: broken include path or XML error leaves the switch unable"
" to open root (`\"Cannot Open log directory or XML Root!\"`)."
msgstr ""
"**失败模式**：include 路径损坏或 XML 错误会导致交换机无法打开根文档（`\"Cannot Open log directory or "
"XML Root!\"`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:136 aacd9a2400ac43459262a2ae45ca32ae
msgid "Session, channel, state machine"
msgstr "会话、通道与状态机"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:138 31e4094c55e34f50bc09be691784115c
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: each call leg is a `switch_core_session_t` (thread, "
"codecs, queues, UUID) wrapping a `switch_channel_t` (state, variables, "
"cause). The core runs `switch_state_handler_table` hooks; endpoints override"
" them (Sofia’s `sofia_on_init` / `sofia_on_routing`)."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：每个呼叫腿是一个 `switch_core_session_t`（线程、编解码器、队列、UUID），内部包裹 "
"`switch_channel_t`（状态、变量、原因）。核心运行 `switch_state_handler_table` "
"钩子；端点可覆盖它们（Sofia 的 `sofia_on_init` / `sofia_on_routing`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:139 fcb67be0e7484c08a1022338123c6a4a
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_core_session.c`, `src/switch_channel.c`, "
"`src/switch_core_state_machine.c`, types in `src/include/switch_types.h` "
"(`switch_channel_state_t`)."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_core_session.c`、`src/switch_channel.c`、`src/switch_core_state_machine.c`，类型在"
" `src/include/switch_types.h`（`switch_channel_state_t`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:140 6d9421a8d09f41009ca7e562438ec4ae
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: hung sessions if an endpoint returns without advancing "
"state; media/proxy flags (`CF_PROXY_MODE`, `CF_PROXY_MEDIA`) change SDP/RTP "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"**失败模式**：端点返回却不推进状态会导致会话挂起；媒体/代理标志（`CF_PROXY_MODE`、`CF_PROXY_MEDIA`）会改变 "
"SDP/RTP 所有权。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:142 dddca1f437ad4a0a8bf5a30838faf60a
msgid ""
"Default inbound path after create: `CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → `CS_ROUTING` "
"(dialplan hunt) → `CS_EXECUTE` (apps) → `CS_EXCHANGE_MEDIA` or hangup path "
"`CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`."
msgstr ""
"创建后的默认入局路径：`CS_NEW` → `CS_INIT` → `CS_ROUTING`（拨号计划查找）→ `CS_EXECUTE`（应用）→ "
"`CS_EXCHANGE_MEDIA`，或挂断路径 `CS_HANGUP` → `CS_REPORTING` → `CS_DESTROY`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:159 560b28bf823b4784a78c00312b0ae9e1
msgid "Module loader"
msgstr "模块加载器"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:161 8bf6ecfb7ba8448b88f4c104ffb508cb
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: dlopen modules from `mod_dir`, register interface "
"tables (endpoint, dialplan, application, codec, API, file, say, ASR, …) on "
"`switch_loadable_module_interface`."
msgstr ""
"**职责**：从 `mod_dir` dlopen 模块，在 `switch_loadable_module_interface` "
"上注册接口表（endpoint、dialplan、application、codec、API、file、say、ASR、…）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:162 945fcfcaefce490f970034e8affa48ac
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_loadable_module.c`, "
"`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`, "
"`src/include/switch_module_interfaces.h`. Modules export "
"`SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION` / `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_loadable_module.c`、`src/include/switch_loadable_module.h`、`src/include/switch_module_interfaces.h`。模块导出"
" `SWITCH_MODULE_DEFINITION` / `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:163 be01cc4b0e1541559e2875b0392b284d
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: missing `.so` or load error is logged; "
"`switch_core_init_and_modload` fails the whole startup if "
"`switch_loadable_module_init(SWITCH_TRUE)` fails."
msgstr ""
"**失败模式**：缺少 `.so` 或加载错误会被记录；若 `switch_loadable_module_init(SWITCH_TRUE)` "
"失败，`switch_core_init_and_modload` 会使整个启动失败。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:165 08e5d567ece047daa4566582d4562dd9
msgid "Media path"
msgstr "媒体路径"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:167 8ffbfbe594de4a8081e4ea3c593013df
msgid ""
"**Responsibilities**: RTP/SRTP, jitter buffer, codecs, video, media bugs "
"(tap/spy)."
msgstr "**职责**：RTP/SRTP、抖动缓冲、编解码器、视频、媒体探针（tap/spy）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:168 25bdf3acbb2742cab513e68a1900c8d4
msgid ""
"**Key entry points**: `src/switch_rtp.c`, `src/switch_core_media.c`, "
"`src/switch_jitterbuffer.c`, codec modules under `src/mod/codecs/`."
msgstr ""
"**关键入口**：`src/switch_rtp.c`、`src/switch_core_media.c`、`src/switch_jitterbuffer.c`，编解码模块位于"
" `src/mod/codecs/`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:169 7dd736c34d174dbd96263deb3fc2375c
msgid ""
"**Failure modes**: NAT, wrong ptime (default 20 ms assumption in "
"`switch.conf.xml`), codec mismatch forcing transcoding."
msgstr "**失败模式**：NAT、错误的 ptime（`switch.conf.xml` 中默认按 20 ms 假设）、编解码不匹配而被迫转码。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:171 c015751e82ec47b8b35310fb282840e3
msgid "Signaling endpoints (in-process)"
msgstr "信令端点（进程内）"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:173 b76ed8133886473f80903efa2303005a
msgid ""
"**Sofia (`mod_sofia`)**: SIP. State handlers in "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/mod_sofia.c`. Profiles in "
"`conf/vanilla/sip_profiles/` (internal auth vs external `auth-calls=false`)."
" Vanilla **internal** `context` is `public`; authenticated directory users "
"override with `user_context` ([Chapter "
"7](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles))."
msgstr ""
"**Sofia（`mod_sofia`）**：SIP。状态处理在 "
"`src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/mod_sofia.c`。配置文件在 "
"`conf/vanilla/sip_profiles/`（内部鉴权 vs 外部 `auth-calls=false`）。Vanilla "
"**internal** 的 `context` 是 `public`；已认证号码簿用户用 `user_context` 覆盖（[第 7 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/users-and-endpoints/sip-"
"profiles)）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:174 9e25f68d25d3404f857c0e18d2fcd583
msgid "**Verto (`mod_verto`)**: HTML5/WebRTC, endpoint name `verto.rtc`."
msgstr "**Verto（`mod_verto`）**：HTML5/WebRTC，端点名 `verto.rtc`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:175 3d1df28db0704f54b9df959aab8cbcd3
msgid ""
"**Loopback / RTC**: in-process and WebRTC helper endpoints loaded by vanilla"
" `modules.conf.xml`."
msgstr "**Loopback / RTC**：vanilla `modules.conf.xml` 加载的进程内与 WebRTC 辅助端点。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:177 0bc597e947ab459287e8c229e2fe4b7c
msgid ""
"Media mode on a Sofia profile ([Chapter "
"17](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/media-and-codecs/handling)):"
" vanilla internal sets `inbound-late-negotiation=true` (defer A-leg codec "
"until after dialplan). `inbound-bypass-media` sets `CF_PROXY_MODE` (RTP "
"endpoint-to-endpoint); `inbound-proxy-media` sets `CF_PROXY_MEDIA` (RTP "
"through the server without payload inspection)."
msgstr ""
"Sofia profile 上的媒体模式（[第 17 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/media-and-"
"codecs/handling)）：vanilla internal 设置 `inbound-late-negotiation=true`（把 A "
"腿编解码推迟到拨号计划之后）。`inbound-bypass-media` 设置 `CF_PROXY_MODE`（RTP 端到端）；`inbound-"
"proxy-media` 设置 `CF_PROXY_MEDIA`（RTP 经服务器但不检查载荷）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:179 a32dee24af884a92954efec6a077ab40
msgid "Dialplan and applications"
msgstr "拨号计划与应用"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:181 fbdc44f8ba594d26b822e6d2fc169919
msgid ""
"**Dialplan**: `mod_dialplan_xml` matches XML extensions "
"(`src/mod/dialplans/mod_dialplan_xml/mod_dialplan_xml.c`). Asterisk-style "
"`mod_dialplan_asterisk` is optional."
msgstr ""
"**拨号计划**：`mod_dialplan_xml` 匹配 XML "
"分机（`src/mod/dialplans/mod_dialplan_xml/mod_dialplan_xml.c`）。Asterisk 风格的 "
"`mod_dialplan_asterisk` 为可选。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:182 e653926a1bb7450c8875c8582a0afb4a
msgid ""
"**Applications**: `mod_dptools` (bridge, answer, playback, …), "
"`mod_conference`, `mod_voicemail`, `mod_commands` (CLI/API). Originate lives"
" in core `switch_ivr_originate()` (`src/switch_ivr_originate.c`)."
msgstr ""
"**应用**：`mod_dptools`（bridge、answer、playback、…）、`mod_conference`、`mod_voicemail`、`mod_commands`（CLI/API）。Originate"
" 位于核心 `switch_ivr_originate()`（`src/switch_ivr_originate.c`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:184 80017a7ecc5342b2929c3c1c3842d26c
msgid "Event engine and ESL"
msgstr "事件引擎与 ESL"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:186 eb703409de6447998d8928e1d1c07230
msgid ""
"**Bus**: APR FIFO + backend thread (`src/include/switch_event.h`). Bind "
"callbacks or consume from `mod_event_socket`."
msgstr ""
"**总线**：APR FIFO + 后端线程（`src/include/switch_event.h`）。绑定回调或从 "
"`mod_event_socket` 消费。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:187 21d568a46a334f3986e51e0b0d9da8d9
msgid ""
"**ESL**: `mod_event_socket` listens (default `127.0.0.1:8021`, password "
"`ClueCon`). `fs_cli` is built from `libs/esl/fs_cli.c`. Auth flag "
"`LFLAG_AUTHED` in `mod_event_socket.c`. Slow consumers must queue locally — "
"the core warns against blocking the delivery thread."
msgstr ""
"**ESL**：`mod_event_socket` 监听（默认 `127.0.0.1:8021`，密码 `ClueCon`）。`fs_cli` 由 "
"`libs/esl/fs_cli.c` 构建。鉴权标志 `LFLAG_AUTHED` 在 "
"`mod_event_socket.c`。慢消费者必须在本地排队——核心警告不要阻塞投递线程。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:189 b7a159c1e0d24f71b6eb3d0501f2ff5d
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:191 4479224147f145dfa3be8ebb3e7d0ab9
msgid ""
"`mod_console`, `mod_logfile` (vanilla loads both). Levels via "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG` macros in `switch_types.h`."
msgstr ""
"`mod_console`、`mod_logfile`（vanilla 两者都加载）。级别通过 `switch_types.h` 中的 "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_LOG` 宏。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:193 60eb19f13ef847868987e9884ea53d3d
msgid "Code-Level View"
msgstr "代码级视图"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:195 9a096e085cfa4b3eb62763865ea573b1
msgid "Only types on the hot path. Full headers are the API; this is the map."
msgstr "仅列出热路径上的类型。完整头文件才是 API；这里是地图。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 14fb542536e44166a3c75dcb18789706
msgid "Area"
msgstr "领域"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 949b7eadb1ab46908730275d5a00a70e
msgid "Important files or symbols"
msgstr "重要文件或符号"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 7042c5731cfa47eb932ba153ce880532
msgid "Why it matters"
msgstr "为何重要"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 d4e1c1d4308649a8aae87206aa4e464d
msgid "Process boot"
msgstr "进程启动"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 0c730283834041d4815f30ccf928d1d4
msgid ""
"`src/switch.c` `main`; `switch_core_init`, `switch_core_init_and_modload`"
msgstr ""
"`src/switch.c` `main`; `switch_core_init`, `switch_core_init_and_modload`"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 f6bb7e7ba5a2474484466ea2a72ad31f
msgid "Single-runlevel init; modules load only in the second function"
msgstr "单运行级初始化；模块仅在第二个函数中加载"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 4477ee7d7de94bbb9d196ef3f8eeb63c
