msgstr "`switch_loadable_module_interface`"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 e7c118abbe5a4d1593ad77ca4b64e79e
msgid "Named tables the core looks up (endpoint, app, codec, API)"
msgstr "核心查找的命名表（endpoint、app、codec、API）"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 a145b8c41f014db2afcbf0c637733dd9
msgid "Events"
msgstr "事件"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 7bd5f1c9fb7d48e2aa82ac61e4b95645
msgid "`switch_event_t`, `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_*`, `SWITCH_EVENT_STARTUP`"
msgstr "`switch_event_t`, `SWITCH_EVENT_CHANNEL_*`, `SWITCH_EVENT_STARTUP`"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 b1de7be995b047b59d86d7e3e884780d
msgid "ESL, CDR, and scripts subscribe here"
msgstr "ESL、CDR 与脚本在此订阅"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 acebb49a0b6f4d51b1cfe1d7aaa96474
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 87ff4305d7434e77b3456c164abd2f41
msgid "`switch_xml_open_root`, preprocessor in `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`"
msgstr "`switch_xml_open_root`，预处理器在 `conf/vanilla/freeswitch.xml`"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 f736f0422b4a4e4f8c91cf2919edc32e
msgid "Config is data, not code"
msgstr "配置是数据，不是代码"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 84abf3a6a0d24668b76106bebbf8ea87
msgid "Originate / bridge"
msgstr "Originate / 桥接"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 c89dafe93a5c4d1abc27dc8ff95a5a3e
msgid "`switch_ivr_originate`, `src/switch_ivr_bridge.c`"
msgstr "`switch_ivr_originate`, `src/switch_ivr_bridge.c`"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:144 70e62a516e944fbdaecb201ba4317c9a
msgid "Outbound legs and B2BUA"
msgstr "出局腿与 B2BUA"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:248 25f580df4a6340269db1d2fdbb2a224b
msgid ""
"UML nearest match: class diagram + state machine (channel states above)."
msgstr "UML 最接近：类图 + 状态机（上方通道状态）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:250 72eb820cb23c4e80b9b5b3cdafa601e6
msgid "Key Runtime Flows"
msgstr "关键运行时流程"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:252 616fcb759fc84806a80dd181e0630c21
msgid "Inbound SIP call (vanilla)"
msgstr "入局 SIP 呼叫（vanilla）"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:279 73c545f26f354b8bba02b58baa1b50dd
msgid ""
"**Success path**: INVITE → session thread → INIT/ROUTING → XML extension → "
"apps (bridge/conference/voicemail) → RTP → hangup/CDR events."
msgstr ""
"**成功路径**：INVITE → 会话线程 → INIT/ROUTING → XML 分机 → "
"应用（bridge/conference/voicemail）→ RTP → 挂断/CDR 事件。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:280 2960869885b04f3980daeafb420183e7
msgid ""
"**Validation boundaries**: Sofia profile ACL (`apply-inbound-acl` on "
"internal profile uses `domains` from `acl.conf.xml`); `auth-calls` on "
"internal vs `false` on external; directory digest auth for users 1000–1019 "
"in vanilla. Authenticated INVITE uses directory `user_context` (`default`); "
"the profile’s own `context=public` is for unauthenticated inbound only "
"([Chapter "
"1](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction) "
"anatomy of a call)."
msgstr ""
"**校验边界**：Sofia 配置文件 ACL（内部配置的 `apply-inbound-acl` 使用 `acl.conf.xml` 中的 "
"`domains`）；内部 `auth-calls` vs 外部 `false`；vanilla 中用户 1000–1019 的号码簿 digest "
"鉴权。已认证 INVITE 使用号码簿 `user_context`（`default`）；profile 自身的 `context=public` "
"仅用于未认证入局（[第 1 "
"章](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/foundations/introduction) "
"呼叫解剖）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:281 3e961f84525944168bc99bfab071a26a
msgid ""
"**Consistency**: one session thread owns the channel state machine. SQL "
"scoreboard is internal (disable with `-nosql`). Channel recovery flags "
"`CF_RECOVERING` skip routing and jump to `CS_EXECUTE`."
msgstr ""
"**一致性**：一个会话线程拥有通道状态机。SQL 记分板是内部的（用 `-nosql` 禁用）。通道恢复标志 `CF_RECOVERING` "
"会跳过路由并跳到 `CS_EXECUTE`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:282 ee1509ecd5ba4dd781c938e1231a26fc
msgid ""
"**Retry / compensation**: SIP retransmits are Sofia/Sofia-SIP’s job. "
"Dialplan `bridge` failover is application-level (pipe-separated gateways), "
"not a core saga. ESL clients must not block the event thread."
msgstr ""
"**重试 / 补偿**：SIP 重传是 Sofia/Sofia-SIP 的职责。拨号计划 `bridge` 故障转移是应用层（管道分隔的网关），不是核心"
" saga。ESL 客户端不得阻塞事件线程。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:284 a1c8d20dbf6b4da386e03771ac53c924
msgid "Outbound originate"
msgstr "出局 originate"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:286 db0b069e634b48e3be094dabeb3ef0df
msgid ""
"`switch_ivr_originate()` allocates an outbound session through the named "
"endpoint (`sofia/gateway/...`, `loopback/...`), runs the same state table "
"with `TFLAG_OUTBOUND` so `sofia_on_init` sends INVITE via "
"`sofia_glue_do_invite()`."
msgstr ""
"`switch_ivr_originate()` 通过指定端点（`sofia/gateway/...`、`loopback/...`）分配出局会话，以 "
"`TFLAG_OUTBOUND` 运行同一状态表，因此 `sofia_on_init` 会经由 `sofia_glue_do_invite()` 发送 "
"INVITE。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:288 37120fa7df1f49d1b709b51a021d0707
msgid "ESL control"
msgstr "ESL 控制"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:290 85c7250edbd5443cbbd719a1156bbbb2
msgid ""
"Client connects to 8021, authenticates, then `api` / `bgapi` / `event` / "
"`sendmsg` (uuid). Health check used by Docker: `fs_cli -x status` must match"
" `^UP`."
msgstr ""
"客户端连接 8021、鉴权，然后 `api` / `bgapi` / `event` / `sendmsg`（uuid）。Docker "
"使用的健康检查：`fs_cli -x status` 必须匹配 `^UP`。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:292 e53a5364e4c941488d8076b17ad51f72
msgid "Cross-Cutting Concerns"
msgstr "横切关注点"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:294 f3eab32d9e424eb28756cc372149d81a
msgid ""
"**Authentication and authorization**: SIP digest + ACL lists "
"(`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/acl.conf.xml`, Sofia `apply-inbound-acl`). "
"ESL password in `event_socket.conf.xml` (default `ClueCon`, loopback only). "
"Directory users are **not** OS users."
msgstr ""
"**认证与授权**：SIP digest + ACL "
"列表（`conf/vanilla/autoload_configs/acl.conf.xml`，Sofia `apply-inbound-"
"acl`）。ESL 密码在 `event_socket.conf.xml`（默认 `ClueCon`，仅回环）。号码簿用户**不是**操作系统用户。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:295 ab32bb6333294e4495c9430e7bfded8a
msgid ""
"**Error handling**: `switch_status_t` and hangup `switch_call_cause_t` on "
"the channel. Endpoints return `SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE` from a state handler to "
"skip the core’s standard handler (`sofia_on_init` comment)."
msgstr ""
"**错误处理**：通道上的 `switch_status_t` 与挂断 `switch_call_cause_t`。端点从状态处理函数返回 "
"`SWITCH_STATUS_FALSE` 以跳过核心的标准处理（见 `sofia_on_init` 注释）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:296 a72d8729186a49dfb833332bbc175e34
msgid ""
"**Logging and tracing**: `switch_log_printf` with session UUID via "
"`SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG`. Sofia `siptrace` is a profile/CLI switch, not "
"distributed tracing. No OpenTelemetry in this tree."
msgstr ""
"**日志与追踪**：通过 `SWITCH_CHANNEL_SESSION_LOG` 带会话 UUID 的 "
"`switch_log_printf`。Sofia `siptrace` 是配置文件/CLI 开关，不是分布式追踪。本源码树没有 "
"OpenTelemetry。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:297 1898ba368fe548cd8720a68b7642c4de
msgid ""
"**Caching**: compiled XML root is memory-mapped (`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`); "
"`reloadxml` re-parses. Directory/ACL can be rebuilt from XML. RTP jitter "
"buffer is per-session, not a shared cache."
msgstr ""
"**缓存**：编译后的 XML 根以内存映射（`freeswitch.xml.fsxml`）；`reloadxml` 会重新解析。号码簿/ACL 可从 "
"XML 重建。RTP 抖动缓冲是每会话的，不是共享缓存。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:298 22eee0da7c494f5db89abdb8975de918
msgid ""
"**Configuration and secrets**: XML under `confdir`; `vars.xml` preprocessor "
"`$$` vars (including `default_password`). Not a secret manager. Change demo "
"passwords before any public bind (`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`)."
msgstr ""
"**配置与密钥**：XML 位于 `confdir`；`vars.xml` 预处理器 `$$` 变量（包括 "
"`default_password`）。不是密钥管理器。对外绑定前请更改演示密码（`conf/vanilla/README_IMPORTANT.txt`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:300 e247edfe05d14803ac8ed81a8d7ec80d
msgid "Deployment and Scaling Notes"
msgstr "部署与扩展说明"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:302 d08973bf55934098b864d4f9b21dbb84
msgid ""
"**Environments**: same binary; profile choice (`vanilla`, `sbc`, `minimal`, "
"`curl`) is the environment. CI builds on Debian containers, macOS, Windows."
msgstr ""
"**环境**：同一二进制；配置档案选择（`vanilla`、`sbc`、`minimal`、`curl`）即环境。CI 在 Debian "
"容器、macOS、Windows 上构建。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:303 6354a9492abe43c99d721ece80f591a5
msgid ""
"**Scaling model**: **vertical** (more cores / less transcoding) and **more "
"processes/hosts** behind an SBC or Kamailio. Not a horizontally sharded in-"
"process cluster. RTP needs host networking in Docker (`docker/README.md`)."
msgstr ""
"**扩展模型**：**纵向**（更多核 / 更少转码）以及在 SBC 或 Kamailio "
"后面部署**更多进程/主机**。不是进程内水平分片集群。Docker 中 RTP 需要主机网络（`docker/README.md`）。"

#: ../../02-architecture.md:304 4d665fd5a8634414a3960163f951affa
msgid ""
"**Recovery**: `-nonat` to skip UPnP pinholes; session recovery flags in the "
"state machine; core SQL can persist some state. Site HA, backups, and RTO "
"are **[NEEDS INPUT: operator-owned]** — not specified in this repo."
msgstr ""
"**恢复**：`-nonat` 跳过 UPnP 打洞；状态机中的会话恢复标志；核心 SQL 可持久化部分状态。站点 HA、备份和 RTO 为 "
"**[NEEDS INPUT: 由运营商自行负责]** —— 本仓库未规定。"

